# Packages vs UI registry

- **Private npm (`@script-augur/*`)**: Vite plugins, ESLint/Prettier/tsconfig, Node utilities, non-UI state machines. Versioned; update via `pnpm update`.
- **shadcn registry (`Script-Augur/ui-registry`)**: UI components, hooks, layouts, agent/editor conventions. Copied into the app and owned locally.

If it imports Node built-ins, hooks into Vite, or has no UI representation → **packages**, never shadcn copy.
